            "review_text": "AFAK25\nJeddah, Saudi Arabia4492 contributions\n0\nTypical Thai-Malay Food\nDec 2023 • Family\nThis restaurant is popular with Malaysians due to its proximity to Ben Thanh Market and the familiar menu.\n\nDishes like fried siakap, mixed tom yam, fried kangkung are staples in Malaysian Thai restaurants. On top of that, I would say the taste is nearer to Malaysian Thai rather than real Thai restaurants. However personally I think the taste is slightly bland. A little bit more chilli would be better.\nRead more\nWritten December 18, 2023",
